    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rope it to The Cow!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Rope Cow \u2013 a fearless bovine on a quest for freedom. With a trusty rope in hoof, swing across epic landscapes in pursuit of liberation. Feel like a ninja using your grappling rope to sort obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501800/extras/ade1cea70e66b11f1769f80a012dcf32.avif?t=1749249760\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURING...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive single-player story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Objective-driven game mode with two intense stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic rope physics for smooth, satisfying swings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heart-thumping sense of accomplishment with every successful stunt</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROPE COW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a game that combines thrilling rope physics and a fresh twist on the classic quest for freedom. Will you help our hero break free, or find yourself wondering: Are we cow\u2026 or are we swinger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stay safe. Be a happy cow.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rope it to The Cow!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet Rope Cow \u2013 a fearless bovine on a quest for freedom. With a trusty rope in hoof, swing across epic landscapes in pursuit of liberation. Feel like a ninja using your grappling rope to sort obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501800/extras/ade1cea70e66b11f1769f80a012dcf32.avif?t=1749249760\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURING...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive single-player story mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Objective-driven game mode with two intense stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic rope physics for smooth, satisfying swings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heart-thumping sense of accomplishment with every successful stunt</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROPE COW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a game that combines thrilling rope physics and a fresh twist on the classic quest for freedom. Will you help our hero break free, or find yourself wondering: Are we cow\u2026 or are we swinger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stay safe. Be a happy cow.</i></p>",
